Mongolo ha-ho-fihla: ['html'] etsa: { <- (
		uena
		nkela-sebaka: ['&'] ka: ['&amp;'],
		nkela-sebaka: ['<'] ka: ['&lt;'],
		nkela-sebaka: ['>'] ka: ['&gt;'],
		nkela-sebaka: ['"'] ka: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Lethathamo ncha.

['Verbatim Syntax'] litlhaku e-ngoe-le-e-ngoe: { :palo :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (palo), Letter: letter).
}.

Sephetho list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list kopanya: ['↵']).

Sephetho ngola: template.

